        {"id": "list-view-actions", "title": "Actions on items", "lead": "For content at the end of each item, such as a badge or an icon button, set `ItemActions`. For a ⋯ menu of `MenuItem`s, set `ItemMenu`; the menu is named \"Actions for\" and the item's label. Keep one or two actions visible and put the rest in the menu. An item whose menu renders nothing has no ⋯ button.", "notes": {"noscript": "Star and each menu item post the form with their Name and Value. The menu opens and closes, but has no arrow keys.", "static": "Star and each menu item post the form with their Name and Value. The menu has arrow keys and type-ahead.", "interactive": "Each button's OnClick runs C#, and nothing is posted."}},
